            "line": 197,
            "text": "theorem decoded (hD : D.Admissible) (h : IsTrajectory D u v a b)\n    (h0 : v a ∈ D.Safe) {s e : ℝ} (hs : a ≤ s) (he : e ≤ b) (inBit : Bool)\n    (hu : ∀ t ∈ Ico s e, D.decodeIn (u t) = some inBit) :\n    ∀ t ∈ Icc s e, s + D.tau inBit ≤ t → D.decodeOut (v t) = some (!inBit) := by"
